0_170670533_0_49713_0_0\n                        - generic [ref=e390]: 去购买\n                        - img [ref=e392]\n              - generic [ref=e395]:\n                - link [ref=e397] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/aggk6vv3/\n                  - img [ref=e398]\n                - generic [ref=e399]:\n                  - link \"云鲸扫地机器人\" [ref=e400] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/aggk6vv3/\n                  - generic [ref=e401]: \"#我与云鲸的十周年故事 云鲸扫地机云鲸智能扫拖机器人，以科技解放双手，打造全屋洁净新体验。强劲吸力高效除尘，防缠绕设计轻松应对毛发与碎屑；智能导航精准建图，灵活避障不留死角。自动洗拖布、热风烘干、自动集尘，全流程自清洁，省心又卫生。恒压强擦去污，顽固污渍一拖即净，APP远程操控更便捷。简约颜值适配各类家居，从客厅到卧室，从地板到地毯，全天候守护居家干净。把繁琐交给云鲸，把舒适留给生活，轻松享受一尘\"\n                  - generic [ref=e402]:\n                    - generic [ref=e403]:\n                      - generic [ref=e404] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e406]\n                        - generic [ref=e408]: \"0\"\n                      - generic [ref=e409] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e411]\n                        - generic [ref=e413]: \"0\"\n                      - link \"0\" [ref=e414] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/aggk6vv3/#panelTitle\n                        - img [ref=e416]\n                        - generic [ref=e418]: \"0\"\n                    - generic [ref=e419]:\n                      - generic [ref=e420]: 03-05\n                      - link \"计划表 计划表\" [ref=e422] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://zhiyou.smzdm.com/member/8274910405/\n                        - img \"计划表\" [ref=e423]\n                        - generic [ref=e424]: 计划表\n              - generic [ref=e426]:\n                - link [ref=e428] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/aggk4dx7/\n                  - img [ref=e429]\n                - generic [ref=e430]:\n                  - link \"扫地机器人，你真的会用吗？\" [ref=e431] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/aggk4dx7/\n                  - generic [ref=e432]: \"#小科守净，福满新年 马年春节把家里打扫得干干净净才好迎接福气，多亏了我的科沃斯扫地机器人！以前过年大扫除要弯腰擦地、蹲身扫角落，累得腰都直不起来，现在交给它就搞定了。它的吸力特别强，瓜子壳、碎纸屑、猫毛都能一次吸干净，拖布还能自动回洗热风烘干，完全不用我动手。过年家里人多，每天让它跑两圈，地面一直亮堂堂的，亲戚来了都夸我家干净又省心。有了小科，终于能把时间留给家人，好好享受团圆年啦～\"\n                  - generic [ref=e433]:\n                    - generic [ref=e434]:\n                      - generic [ref=e435] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e437]\n                        - generic [ref=e439]: \"0\"\n                      - generic [ref=e440] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e442]\n                        - generic [ref=e444]: \"0\"\n                      - link \"0\" [ref=e445] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/aggk4dx7/#panelTitle\n                        - img [ref=e447]\n                        - generic [ref=e449]: \"0\"\n                    - generic [ref=e450]:\n                      - generic [ref=e451]: 03-10\n                      - link \"值友9440203614 值友9440203614\" [ref=e453] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://zhiyou.smzdm.com/member/1247702244/\n                        - img \"值友9440203614\" [ref=e454]\n                        - generic [ref=e455]: 值友9440203614\n              - generic [ref=e457]:\n                - link [ref=e459] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/p/170288333/\n                  - img [ref=e460]\n                - generic [ref=e461]:\n                  - link \"百亿补贴：科沃斯 扫地机器人X11 Pro无限续航滚筒洗地扫拖一体自动清洗家用\" [ref=e462] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/p/170288333/\n                  - link \"3329元（多人团）\" [ref=e463] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/p/170288333/\n                  - link \"百亿补贴\" [ref=e465] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/tag/t5vm9y7/youhui/\n                  - generic [ref=e467]:\n                    - generic [ref=e469]:\n                      - generic [ref=e470]:\n                        - generic [ref=e471] [cursor=pointer]:\n                          - img [ref=e473]\n                          - generic [ref=e475]: \"0\"\n                        - generic [ref=e476] [cursor=pointer]:\n                          - img [ref=e478]\n                          - generic [ref=e480]: \"0\"\n                      - generic [ref=e481] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e483]\n                        - generic [ref=e485]: \"0\"\n                      - link \"0\" [ref=e486] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/p/170288333/#panelTitle\n                        - img [ref=e488]\n                        - generic [ref=e490]: \"0\"\n                    - generic [ref=e492]:\n                      - generic [ref=e493]: 03-15\n                      - link \"拼多多\" [ref=e494] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/mall/pinduoduo/\n                        - generic [ref=e495]: 拼多多\n                      - generic [ref=e496] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e498]\n                        - generic [ref=e500]: 扫码购\n                      - link \"去购买\" [ref=e501] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://go.smzdm.com/7d88a12242f63ed2/ca_aa_fx_0_170288333_0_395_0_0\n                        - generic [ref=e502]: 去购买\n                        - img [ref=e504]\n              - generic [ref=e507]:\n                - link [ref=e509] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/avgn24vp/\n                  - img [ref=e510]\n                - generic [ref=e511]:\n                  - link \"云鲸扫地机器人，我的生活小帮手～\" [ref=e512] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/avgn24vp/\n                  - generic [ref=e513]: 大家都知道，一个家尤其是有了孩子的家，基本上经常会被熊孩子弄的“又脏又乱”，再加上我喜欢经常开窗通风，家里的桌面、地面常常都会有垃圾灰尘，每周两次的彻底清扫是必不可少的。由于工作带娃，时间和精力有限，我入手了云鲸扫地机器人，它给我省了不少事。 每周两次的家庭大扫除，我只要打开开关，让它满屋子跑，没一会儿家里的角角落落，都会“焕然一新”，真的是比“猪队友”都靠谱的贴心小帮手！#我与云鲸的十周年故事\n                  - generic [ref=e514]:\n                    - generic [ref=e515]:\n                      - generic [ref=e516] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e518]\n                        - generic [ref=e520]: \"0\"\n                      - generic [ref=e521] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e523]\n                        - generic [ref=e525]: \"0\"\n                      - link \"0\" [ref=e526] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/avgn24vp/#panelTitle\n                        - img [ref=e528]\n                        - generic [ref=e530]: \"0\"\n                    - generic [ref=e531]:\n                      - generic [ref=e532]: 03-05\n                      - link \"完美公主 完美公主\" [ref=e534] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://zhiyou.smzdm.com/member/8998095186/\n                        - img \"完美公主\" [ref=e535]\n                        - generic [ref=e536]: 完美公主\n              - generic [ref=e538]:\n                - link [ref=e540] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/a6z3q2zg/\n                  - img [ref=e541]\n                - generic [ref=e542]:\n                  - link \"云鲸扫地机器人，懒人必备清洁神器？\" [ref=e543] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/a6z3q2zg/\n                  - generic [ref=e544]: \"#我与云鲸的十周年故事 终于入手石头洗地机，彻底告别弯腰拖地！AI全向助力超丝滑，推拉轻松不费力，老人也能轻松用。大吸力+贴边设计，干湿垃圾一遍搞定，厨房油污、客厅碎屑全清理干净。双重鲨齿0缠毛，养宠、长发家庭无压力。180°躺平清洁床底死角，自带自清洁+热风烘干，不用手洗滚刷，不发霉无异味。清洁高效、省心省力，全屋干净又清爽，提升幸福感的家居好物，懒人必备！\"\n                  - generic [ref=e545]:\n                    - generic [ref=e546]:\n                      - generic [ref=e547] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e549]\n                        - generic [ref=e551]: \"0\"\n                      - generic [ref=e552] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e554]\n                        - generic [ref=e556]: \"0\"\n                      - link \"0\" [ref=e557] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/a6z3q2zg/#panelTitle\n                        - img [ref=e559]\n                        - generic [ref=e561]: \"0\"\n                    - generic [ref=e562]:\n                      - generic [ref=e563]: 03-06\n                      - link \"怎知 怎知\" [ref=e565] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://zhiyou.smzdm.com/member/3209381166/\n                        - img \"怎知\" [ref=e566]\n                        - generic [ref=e567]: 怎知\n              - generic [ref=e569]:\n                - link [ref=e571] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/p/170294787/\n                  - img [ref=e572]\n                - generic [ref=e573]:\n                  - link \"今日必买：石头 扫地机 P20 Ultra Plus扫拖洗烘一体自动集尘热水洗拖布拖地\" [ref=e574] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/p/170294787/\n                  - link \"3299元\" [ref=e575] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/p/170294787/\n                  - generic [ref=e577]:\n                    - generic [ref=e579]:\n                      - generic [ref=e580]:\n                        - generic [ref=e581] [cursor=pointer]:\n                          - img [ref=e583]\n                          - generic [ref=e585]: \"1\"\n                        - generic [ref=e586] [cursor=pointer]:\n                          - img [ref=e588]\n                          - generic [ref=e590]: \"2\"\n                      - generic [ref=e591] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e593]\n                        - generic [ref=e595]: \"7\"\n                      - link \"17\" [ref=e596] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/p/170294787/#panelTitle\n                        - img [ref=e598]\n                        - generic [ref=e600]: \"17\"\n                    - generic [ref=e602]:\n                      - generic [ref=e603]: 03-15\n                      - link \"拼多多\" [ref=e604] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/mall/pinduoduo/\n                        - generic [ref=e605]: 拼多多\n                      - generic [ref=e606] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e608]\n                        - generic [ref=e610]: 扫码购\n                      - link \"去购买\" [ref=e611] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://go.smzdm.com/3e83ebe391104c6a/ca_aa_yh_0_170294787_0_49713_0_0\n                        - generic [ref=e612]: 去购买\n                        - img [ref=e614]\n              - generic [ref=e617]:\n                - link [ref=e619] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/a26874e2/\n                  - img [ref=e620]\n                - generic [ref=e621]:\n                  - link \"小科守净：科沃斯T80s扫地机器人开启新年洁净新篇\" [ref=e622] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/a26874e2/\n                  - generic [ref=e623]: \"#小科守净，福满新年 家里的大扫除是头等大事。传统清扫方式不仅累得腰酸背痛，还总有些边边角角清理不到位。这时候，一台智能高效的扫地机器人就成了救星。在众多产品中，科沃斯T80s扫地机器人凭借其出色的性能和贴心的设计，成为新年清洁的不二之选，下面就为大家详细分享我的使用体验与选购攻略。选购攻略：为何科沃斯T80s脱颖而出清洁能力是关键扫地机器人的核心任务就是清洁，科沃斯T80s在这方面表现堪称卓越。\"\n                  - generic [ref=e624]:\n                    - generic [ref=e625]:\n                      - generic [ref=e626] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e628]\n                        - generic [ref=e630]: \"0\"\n                      - generic [ref=e631] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e633]\n                        - generic [ref=e635]: \"0\"\n                      - link \"0\" [ref=e636] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/a26874e2/#panelTitle\n                        - img [ref=e638]\n                        - generic [ref=e640]: \"0\"\n                    - generic [ref=e641]:\n                      - generic [ref=e642]: 03-10\n                      - link \"好看好看好好看 好看好看好好看\" [ref=e644] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://zhiyou.smzdm.com/member/7198037263/\n                        - img \"好看好看好好看\" [ref=e645]\n                        - generic [ref=e646]: 好看好看好好看\n              - generic [ref=e648]:\n                - link [ref=e650] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/a70q2en9/\n                  - img [ref=e651]\n                - generic [ref=e652]:\n                  - link \"云鲸扫地机器人使用体验\" [ref=e653] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/a70q2en9/\n                  - generic [ref=e654]: \"#我与云鲸的十周年故事 前几天买了云鲸JX扫地机器人，说实话网上挺多说扫地机是智商税的，我还有点担心，用了几天感觉确实比我预期的好 它是真聪明，遇上我家地上散落的充电线、掉的纸巾，这么细小的东西，都不会卷进去，都是贴着把周围擦干净了，像遥控器钥匙有时候不知道掉哪个角落了，它打扫看到了还会给我顺手在app标记出来，提醒我过去捡回来。我买的时候就是冲着它的AI双目，说是四五千高端机才有的技术，现在用下\"\n                  - generic [ref=e655]:\n                    - generic [ref=e656]:\n                      - generic [ref=e657] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e659]\n                        - generic [ref=e661]: \"1\"\n                      - generic [ref=e662] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e664]\n                        - generic [ref=e666]: \"0\"\n                      - link \"0\" [ref=e667] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/a70q2en9/#panelTitle\n                        - img [ref=e669]\n                        - generic [ref=e671]: \"0\"\n                    - generic [ref=e672]:\n                      - generic [ref=e673]: 03-05\n                      - link \"值友3273756222 值友3273756222\" [ref=e675] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://zhiyou.smzdm.com/member/8096978641/\n              