neric [ref=e946] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e948]\n                        - generic [ref=e950]: \"1\"\n                      - link \"1\" [ref=e951] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/p/170352301/#panelTitle\n                        - img [ref=e953]\n                        - generic [ref=e955]: \"1\"\n                    - generic [ref=e957]:\n                      - generic [ref=e958]: 03-16\n                      - link \"天猫精选\" [ref=e959] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/mall/tmall/\n                        - generic [ref=e960]: 天猫精选\n                      - link \"去购买\" [ref=e961] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://go.smzdm.com/9cf9e32f1d56fba2/ca_aa_yh_0_170352301_0_395_0_0\n                        - generic [ref=e962]: 去购买\n                        - img [ref=e964]\n              - generic [ref=e967]:\n                - link [ref=e969] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/ak86kpkk/\n                  - img [ref=e970]\n                - generic [ref=e971]:\n                  - link \"科沃斯扫地机器人的清洁效果\" [ref=e972] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/ak86kpkk/\n                  - generic [ref=e973]: \"#小科守净，福满新年 科沃斯扫地产品的清洁效果，核心靠OZMO ROLLER恒压活水洗地技术与飓风吸力双驱动，能搞定日常浮灰、毛发、厨房油污，还能应对打翻的咖啡、番茄酱这类顽固湿污，大户型、养宠/有娃家庭都能适配。一、核心清洁技术：为什么效果能打？• OZMO ROLLER恒压活水洗地：这是科沃斯的王牌，3700-3800Pa对地压强+每分钟200次高速滚筒，是普通拖布盘的16倍清洁力。搭配喷-洗\"\n                  - generic [ref=e974]:\n                    - generic [ref=e975]:\n                      - generic [ref=e976] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e978]\n                        - generic [ref=e980]: \"0\"\n                      - generic [ref=e981] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e983]\n                        - generic [ref=e985]: \"0\"\n                      - link \"0\" [ref=e986] [cursor=pointer]:\n    