eneric [ref=e155]:\n                  - link \"扫地机器人推荐2026选购必看|科沃斯、石头、小米、追觅哪款好？\" [ref=e156] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/p/apwdo6k7/\n                  - generic [ref=e157]: 一、如何正确选购扫地机器人？看完这节就不会踩坑选购扫地机器人，要想避坑不踩雷，一看销量，优先买一线品牌，二看测评，多看分享真实使用体验的测评文章或用户反馈。1、如何避免买到智障扫地机？建图、路线规划及避障性能，直接决定一台扫地机器人使用体验的下限，这三项拉胯的扫地机器人，清洁能力再强，也是智障扫地机/工业垃圾。建图、路线规划及避障取决于硬件和算法。先说建图和路线规划，目前行业公认LDS激光雷达是目\n                  - generic [ref=e158]:\n                    - generic [ref=e159]:\n                      - generic [ref=e160] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e162]\n                        - generic [ref=e164]: \"13\"\n                      - generic [ref=e165] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e167]\n                        - generic [ref=e169]: \"53\"\n                      - link \"12\" [ref=e170] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/p/apwdo6k7/#panelTitle\n                        - img [ref=e172]\n                        - generic [ref=e174]: \"12\"\n                    - generic [ref=e175]:\n                      - generic [ref=e176]: 02-09\n                      - link \"给猫主子赚猫粮 给猫主子赚猫粮\" [ref=e178] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://zhiyou.smzdm.com/member/7380851080/\n                        - img \"给猫主子赚猫粮\" [ref=e179]\n                        - generic [ref=e180]: 给猫主子赚猫粮\n                        - img [ref=e181]\n              - generic [ref=e183]:\n                - link [ref=e185] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/ae6mq4p3/\n                  - img [ref=e186]\n                - generic [ref=e187]:\n                  - link \"科沃斯T80S水箱版全自动扫地机器人\" [ref=e188] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/ae6mq4p3/\n                  - generic [ref=e189]: \"#小科守净，福满新年 科沃斯T80S水箱版是扫拖洗烘一体全自动扫地机器人，搭载滚筒活水洗地2.0，四步活水循环，3800Pa恒压强效去污，告别脏拖布二次污染。24800Pa大吸力搭配灵缠3.0防缠绕，毛发、碎屑、缝隙灰尘一网打尽，灵隙3.0贴边清扫无死角。三重智驱升降，遇地毯自动抬拖布，AIVI 3D避障灵活绕行不卡顿。基站支持75℃高温洗、63℃热风烘干，全水路抗菌，自动集尘、自清洁一步到位。9\"\n                  - generic [ref=e190]:\n                    - generic [ref=e191]:\n                      - generic [ref=e192] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e194]\n                        - generic [ref=e196]: \"2\"\n                      - generic [ref=e197] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e199]\n                        - generic [ref=e201]: \"1\"\n                      - link \"0\" [ref=e202] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/ae6mq4p3/#panelTitle\n                        - img [ref=e204]\n                        - generic [ref=e206]: \"0\"\n                    - generic [ref=e207]:\n                      - generic [ref=e208]: 03-11\n                      - link \"西瓜西瓜rui 西瓜西瓜rui\" [ref=e210] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://zhiyou.smzdm.com/member/8406645525/\n                        - img \"西瓜西瓜rui\" [ref=e211]\n                        - generic [ref=e212]: 西瓜西瓜rui\n              - generic [ref=e214]:\n                - link [ref=e216] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/p/170527665/\n                  - img [ref=e217]\n                - generic [ref=e218]:\n                  - link \"国家补贴、今日必买：科沃斯 T80S 扫地机器人 超薄上下水版\" [ref=e219] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/p/170527665/\n                  - link \"2786.64元包邮（多重优惠）\" [ref=e220] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/p/170527665/\n                  - generic [ref=e221]:\n                    - link \"历史低价\" [ref=e222] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/tag/t8602je/youhui/\n                    - link \"价格低于双11\" [ref=e223]:\n                      - /url: javascript:void(0)\n                  - generic [ref=e224]:\n                    - text: 科沃斯T80S是科沃斯于2025年9月发布的全能滚筒活水洗地机器人新品，接力上一代