Ultra 的升级款，它以 “把清洁做到极致” 为目标，在清洁力、便捷性、适配性上全面突破。外观方面，延续了 P20 系列...\n                    - link \"阅读全文\" [ref=e712] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/p/170664990/\n                  - generic [ref=e713]:\n                    - generic [ref=e715]:\n                      - generic [ref=e716]:\n                        - generic [ref=e717] [cursor=pointer]:\n                          - img [ref=e719]\n                          - generic [ref=e721]: \"13\"\n                        - generic [ref=e722] [cursor=pointer]:\n                          - img [ref=e724]\n                          - generic [ref=e726]: \"7\"\n                      - generic [ref=e727] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e729]\n                        - generic [ref=e731]: \"16\"\n                      - link \"15\" [ref=e732] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/p/170664990/#panelTitle\n                        - img [ref=e734]\n                        - generic [ref=e736]: \"15\"\n                    - generic [ref=e738]:\n                      - generic [ref=e739]: 03-20\n                      - link \"天猫精选\" [ref=e740] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/mall/tmall/\n                        - generic [ref=e741]: 天猫精选\n                      - link \"去购买\" [ref=e742] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://go.smzdm.com/ca1bf7e9d8f0f9bd/ca_aa_yh_0_170664990_0_49713_0_0\n                        - generic [ref=e743]: 去购买\n                        - img [ref=e745]\n              - generic [ref=e748]:\n                - link [ref=e750] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/a6z3drp0/\n                  - img [ref=e751]\n                - generic [ref=e752]:\n                  - link \"科沃斯扫地机器人守护干净家庭\" [ref=e753] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/a6z3drp0/\n                  - generic [ref=e754]: \"#小科守净，福满新年 💡产品名称科沃斯T80s扫地机器人🔎产品描述科沃斯T80S是一款全能型扫拖一体机，主打“滚筒活水洗地”技术，通过“喷淋、滚洗、刮挤、回收”四步循环，实时清洁拖布，避免二次污染。配备24800Pa飓风吸力和3800Pa恒压强擦洗，能有效处理厨房油污、宠物毛发等顽固污渍。98mm超薄机身可进入低矮空间，配合智能三抬升系统，能自动识别并避开地毯、浴室等特殊地面。✨体验亮点1，清洁力\"\n                  - generic [ref=e755]:\n                    - generic [ref=e756]:\n                      - generic [ref=e757] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e759]\n                        - generic [ref=e761]: \"0\"\n                      - generic [ref=e762] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e764]\n                        - generic [ref=e766]: \"0\"\n                      - link \"0\" [ref=e767] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/a6z3drp0/#panelTitle\n                        - img [ref=e769]\n                        - generic [ref=e771]: \"0\"\n                    - generic [ref=e772]:\n                      - generic [ref=e773]: 03-10\n                      - link \"韩伤语 韩伤语\" [ref=e775] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://zhiyou.smzdm.com/member/9304090076/\n                        - img \"韩伤语\" [ref=e776]\n                        - generic [ref=e777]: 韩伤语\n              - generic [ref=e779]:\n                - link [ref=e781] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/aqr8qxnx/\n                  - img [ref=e782]\n                - generic [ref=e783]:\n                  - link \"科沃斯扫地机器人很不错\" [ref=e784] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/aqr8qxnx/\n                  - generic [ref=e785]: \"#小科守净，福满新年 科沃斯扫拖机器人，真是家里的“劳模”。每天早上自动上岗，扫拖一体，头发、灰尘、宠物毛发全搞定，连沙发底都能钻进去。自动集尘、自动洗烘拖布，全程不用我操心，真正解放双手。过年家里来了几拨亲戚，地板上常有瓜子壳、零食碎屑。我只要在APP上点一下，或者喊一声语音指令，它立刻出动，一会儿功夫地面就光洁如新。家里干净了，待客也特别有面子。科沃斯绝对是提升生活幸福感的“宝藏家电”，懒人必\"\n                  - generic [ref=e786]:\n                    - generic [ref=e787]:\n                      - generic [ref=e788] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [r