     - generic [ref=e824]:\n                    - generic [ref=e826]:\n                      - generic [ref=e827]:\n                        - generic [ref=e828] [cursor=pointer]:\n                          - img [ref=e830]\n                          - generic [ref=e832]: \"6\"\n                        - generic [ref=e833] [cursor=pointer]:\n                          - img [ref=e835]\n                          - generic [ref=e837]: \"0\"\n                      - generic [ref=e838] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e840]\n                        - generic [ref=e842]: \"3\"\n                      - link \"2\" [ref=e843] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/p/170529626/#panelTitle\n                        - img [ref=e845]\n                        - generic [ref=e847]: \"2\"\n                    - generic [ref=e849]:\n                      - generic [ref=e850]: 03-18\n                      - link \"天猫超市\" [ref=e851] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/mall/tmallchaoshi/\n                        - generic [ref=e852]: 天猫超市\n                      - link \"去购买\" [ref=e853] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://go.smzdm.com/6f33cc1e80a81fc6/ca_aa_yh_0_170529626_0_395_0_0\n                        - generic [ref=e854]: 去购买\n                        - img [ref=e856]\n              - generic [ref=e859]:\n                - link [ref=e861] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/a70qkkrg/\n                  - img [ref=e862]\n                - generic [ref=e863]:\n                  - link \"科沃斯扫地机器人颜值高科技感满满，家务轻松搞定\" [ref=e864] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/a70qkkrg/\n                  - generic [ref=e865]: \"#小科守净，福满新年 用了一段时间科沃斯扫地机器人，真心觉得是提升居家幸福感的神器。吸力很足，日常灰尘、毛发、碎屑都能轻松吸干净，床底、沙发底这些平时难清理的死角也能钻进去打扫，再也不用弯腰费力。拖地效果也很在线，恒压活水洗地，厨房油渍、地面污渍一遍就能拖干净，不留水痕，木地板拖完清爽发亮。智能避障很靠谱，能精准识别桌椅腿、小杂物，不卡不撞，路径规划有序，不重复不漏扫。APP操作简单，还支持语音控\"\n                  - generic [ref=e866]:\n                    - generic [ref=e867]:\n                      - generic [ref=e868] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e870]\n                        - generic [ref=e872]: \"0\"\n                      - generic [ref=e873] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e875]\n                        - generic [ref=e877]: \"0\"\n                      - link \"0\" [ref=e878] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/a70qkkrg/#panelTitle\n                        - img [ref=e880]\n                        - generic [ref=e882]: \"0\"\n                    - generic [ref=e883]:\n                      - generic [ref=e884]: 03-09\n                      - link \"黑胡椒白胡椒 黑胡椒白胡椒\" [ref=e886] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://zhiyou.smzdm.com/member/2781338379/\n                        - img \"黑胡椒白胡椒\" [ref=e887]\n                        - generic [ref=e888]: 黑胡椒白胡椒\n              - generic [ref=e890]:\n                - link [ref=e892] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/a3m690p5/\n                  - img [ref=e893]\n                - generic [ref=e894]:\n                  - link \"云鲸扫地机器人\" [ref=e895] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/a3m690p5/\n                  - generic [ref=e896]: \"#我与云鲸的十周年故事 我与云鲸，相伴十年 时光匆匆，我与云鲸扫地机器人已携手走过十载。从初见它小巧灵动的模样，到如今它成为家中不可或缺的一员，这段陪伴温暖又踏实。 十年前，家务繁琐总让人疲惫，云鲸的出现，彻底解放了我的双手。它安静穿梭于客厅、卧室、厨房，扫去尘埃，拖净污渍，用智能与高效守护家的洁净。从初代到迭代升级，吸力更强、导航更准、自清洁更省心，云鲸始终以创新贴近生活，懂我对整洁与轻松的向往\"\n                  - generic [ref=e897]:\n                    - generic [ref=e898]:\n                      - generic [ref=e899] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e901]\n                        - generic [ref=e903]: \"2\"\n                      - generic [ref=e904] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e906]\n                        - generic [ref=e908]: \"0\"\n                      - link \"0\" [ref=e909] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/a3m690p5/#panelTitle\n                        - img [ref=e911]\n                        - generic [ref=e913]: \"0\"\n                    - generic [ref=e914]:\n                      - generic [ref=e915]: 03-05\n                      - link \"breia breia\" [ref=e917] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://zhiyou.smzdm.com/member/1949451240/\n                        - img \"breia\" [ref=e918]\n                        - generic [ref=e919]: breia\n              - generic [ref=e921]:\n                - link [ref=e923] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/p/170352301/\n                  - img [ref=e924]\n                - generic [ref=e925]:\n                  - link \"科沃斯 洗地扫地机器人T80S/T80滚筒活洗扫地拖地自动清洗一体机\" [ref=e926] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/p/170352301/\n                  - link \"2680元\" [ref=e927] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/p/170352301/\n                  - link \"303天新低\" [ref=e929]:\n                    - /url: javascript:void(0)\n                  - generic [ref=e930]:\n                    - text: 科沃斯于2025年2月发布的新品T80系列扫地机器人，该产品采用全新包豪斯极简美学设计，外观简洁时尚，同时在功能上实现了显著升级。它搭载了与上代高端爆品X8系列...\n                    - link \"阅读全文\" [ref=e931] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/p/170352301/\n                  - generic [ref=e932]:\n                    - generic [ref=e934]:\n                      - generic [ref=e935]:\n                        - generic [ref=e936] [cursor=pointer]:\n                          - img [ref=e938]\n                          - generic [ref=e940]: \"8\"\n                        - generic [ref=e941] [cursor=pointer]:\n                          - img [ref=e943]\n                          - generic [ref=e945]: \"2\"\n                      - generic [ref=e946] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e948]\n                        - generic [ref=e950]: \"1\"\n                      - link \"1\" [ref=e951] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/p/170352301/#panelTitle\n                        - img [ref=e953]\n                        - generic [ref=e955]: \"1\"\n                    - generic [ref=e957]:\n                      - generic [ref=e958]: 03-16\n                      - link \"天猫精选\" [ref=e959] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://www.smzdm.com/mall/tmall/\n                        - generic [ref=e960]: 天猫精选\n                      - link \"去购买\" [ref=e961] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - /url: https://go.smzdm.com/9cf9e32f1d56fba2/ca_aa_yh_0_170352301_0_395_0_0\n                        - generic [ref=e962]: 去购买\n                        - img [ref=e964]\n              - generic [ref=e967]:\n                - link [ref=e969] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/ak86kpkk/\n                  - img [ref=e970]\n                - generic [ref=e971]:\n                  - link \"科沃斯扫地机器人的清洁效果\" [ref=e972] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: https://post.smzdm.com/talk/p/ak86kpkk/\n                  - generic [ref=e973]: \"#小科守净，福满新年 科沃斯扫地产品的清洁效果，核心靠OZMO ROLLER恒压活水洗地技术与飓风吸力双驱动，能搞定日常浮灰、毛发、厨房油污，还能应对打翻的咖啡、番茄酱这类顽固湿污，大户型、养宠/有娃家庭都能适配。一、核心清洁技术：为什么效果能打？• OZMO ROLLER恒压活水洗地：这是科沃斯的王牌，3700-3800Pa对地压强+每分钟200次高速滚筒，是普通拖布盘的16倍清洁力。搭配喷-洗\"\n                  - generic [ref=e974]:\n                    - generic [ref=e975]:\n                      - generic [ref=e976] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e978]\n                        - generic [ref=e980]: \"0\"\n                      - generic [ref=e981] [cursor=pointer]:\n                        - img [ref=e983]\n                        - generic [ref=e985]: \"0\"\n                      - link \"0\" [ref=e986] [cursor=pointer]:\n    